WEBVTT

00:29:28.458 --> 00:29:30.792
That's when people are
more likely to share back.

00:29:31.667 --> 00:29:33.809
Christiana started
by giving some background

00:29:33.833 --> 00:29:35.434
on where she was coming from.

00:29:35.458 --> 00:29:37.393
CF: Costa Rica doesn't have any carbon,

00:29:37.417 --> 00:29:40.268
so we see the world
very, very differently.

00:29:40.292 --> 00:29:43.851
AG: She acknowledged that they
might be coming from a different place.

00:29:43.875 --> 00:29:47.143
She said her goal was to work together
toward a global solution.

00:29:47.167 --> 00:29:51.018
CF: Because let's remember,
no single country, big or small,

00:29:51.042 --> 00:29:56.309
no single country can actually get us
to where we need to be on climate change.

00:29:56.333 --> 00:29:58.226
AG: Then she started asking questions.

00:29:58.250 --> 00:29:59.518
CF: For me to understand

00:29:59.542 --> 00:30:03.143
but also to help them understand
where that sweet spot was.